# EMPTY U RANGES (no link, no tag — a non-detection here is correct, not a miss)
# server_rack_1, server_rack_5: none (42U occupied)
# server_rack_2, server_rack_6: none (42U occupied)
# server_rack_3, server_rack_7: U23-U24, U40-U42                     (5U empty, 37U occupied)
# server_rack_4, server_rack_8: U6, U10, U14-U17, U28, U33-U38, U40-U41
#                                                                    (15U empty, 27U occupied)
# TAG COUNTS: rack_1=22  rack_2=23  rack_3=13  rack_4=11
#             rack_5=22  rack_6=23  rack_7=13  rack_8=11   total=138
# server_room.sdf instantiates every rack TWICE (rows 0/2 = racks 1-4, rows 1/3 = racks 5-8),
# so that world contains 276 tag entities over 138 distinct EPCs.
